{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_122_pfgm-title\">PFGM++</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">PFGM++ 用可调增广维度 D 的 Poisson 电场统一 PFGM 与 diffusion，而不是固定高斯前向噪声过程。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Embeds N-dimensional data on the z=0 hyperplane of an N+D augmented space and learns the high-dimensional Poisson electric field lines, unifying PFGM (D=1) and Diffusion (D→∞).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">训练数据 x∈R^N；采样时为 N+D 维简单先验状态</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Training data x ∈ R^N embedded in R^{N+D}; hemispherical prior samples at large radius r_max during generation</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">沿学习电场 ODE 流回数据超平面的生成样本</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Samples generated by integrating the learned augmented electric field ODE back to the z=0 hyperplane</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v202/xu23m.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_122_pfgm')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_122_pfgm')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"PFGM++ original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/342a19412e82816a0d3d.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_122_pfgm', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_122_pfgm\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_122_pfgm')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_122_pfgm', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_122_pfgm\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">数据分布 p(x)</span><span class=\"lang-en\">p(x</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">位于增广空间 r=0 的 N 维超平面</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests training data x ∈ r^n embedded in r^{n+d}; hemispherical prior samples at large radius r_max during generation and prepares initial tensor representations (p(x).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"位于增广空间 r=0 的 N 维超平面\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests training data x ∈ r^n embedded in r^{n+d}; hemispherical prior samples at large radius r_max during generation and prepares initial tensor representations (p(x).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"数据分布 p(x)\" data-node-name-en=\"p(x\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_122_pfgm', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">数据分布 p(x)</span><span class=\"lang-en\">p(x</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">位于增广空间 r=0 的 N 维超平面</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests training data x ∈ r^n embedded in r^{n+d}; hemispherical prior samples at large radius r_max during generation and prepares initial tensor representations (p(x).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"为每个样本附加半径 r 与方向，形成 N+D 维空间\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"D 维增广坐标\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_122_pfgm', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">D 维增广坐标</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">为每个样本附加半径 r 与方向，形成 N+D 维空间</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按与 r、D 相关的重尾分布扰动数据，构造不同半径训练样本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Poisson perturbation kernel within the core augmented poisson electrostatic flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Poisson perturbation kernel\" data-node-name-en=\"Poisson perturbation kernel\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_122_pfgm', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Poisson perturbation kernel</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按与 r、D 相关的重尾分布扰动数据，构造不同半径训练样本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Poisson perturbation kernel within the core augmented poisson electrostatic flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"学习高维 Poisson 场的归一化方向或等价 score 参数化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 04 within the core augmented poisson electrostatic flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"电场/方向网络\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 04\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_122_pfgm', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">电场/方向网络</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 04</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">学习高维 Poisson 场的归一化方向或等价 score 参数化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 04 within the core augmented poisson electrostatic flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"回归扰动样本指向数据电荷分布的目标场\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Field matching loss within the core augmented poisson electrostatic flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Field matching loss\" data-node-name-en=\"Field matching loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_122_pfgm', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Field matching loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">回归扰动样本指向数据电荷分布的目标场</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Field matching loss within the core augmented poisson electrostatic flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在半球/球面附近初始化采样状态\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs prior within the core augmented poisson electrostatic flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"大半径简单先验\" data-node-name-en=\"prior\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_122_pfgm', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">大半径简单先验</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prior</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在半球/球面附近初始化采样状态</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs prior within the core augmented poisson electrostatic flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从大 r 沿学习场积分到 r→0\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Poisson flow ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Poisson flow ODE\" data-node-name-en=\"Poisson flow ODE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_122_pfgm', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Poisson flow ODE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从大 r 沿学习场积分到 r→0</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Poisson flow ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"落回数据超平面得到 x\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces samples generated by integrating the learned augmented electric field ode back to the z=0 hyperplane via Synthesized Sample.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"生成样本\" data-node-name-en=\"Synthesized Sample\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_122_pfgm', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成样本</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Synthesized Sample</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">落回数据超平面得到 x</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces samples generated by integrating the learned augmented electric field ode back to the z=0 hyperplane via Synthesized Sample.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"PFGM++ Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · D 维 Poisson 扰动核与反向场 ODE</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Augmented D-Dimensional Heavy-Tailed Poisson Perturbation Kernel &amp; Electric Field ODE</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"PFGM++：核心公式 · D 维 Poisson 扰动核与反向场 ODE\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"122\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"28.872708pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.028346 -68.989847 218.744926 28.872708\" width=\"218.744926pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.610385 10.40184C1.528515 9.181013 1.369708 6.888241 1.369708 5.052039S1.40941 1.012393 2.610385-.357315L2.49128-.555824C2.01486-.158807 .496271 1.766725 .496271 5.052039S2.01486 10.213257 2.49128 10.610274L2.610385 10.40184Z\" id=\"m122_g4-0\